OL,3,GNEWSA'We need more support, not just
OL,4,Aantidepressants'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actress who was first prescribed
OL,7,Fantidepressants 30 years ago has called
OL,8,Ffor greater support to be given to
OL,9,Fpeople taking the medication.
OL,11,FSarah-Jane Honeywell, 52, from Lincoln,
OL,12,Fsaid she had made several attempts to
OL,13,Fstop taking fluoxetine but had been
OL,14,Fleft overwhelmed by withdrawal
OL,15,Fsymptoms.
OL,17,F"I feel like I was just left on it for
OL,18,Fa while. There was no real follow-up,"
OL,19,Fshe said.
